      "is_best": true,
      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>I might have found what I did. The USB-C Source is a “cold socket” during the initial connection. If I’m not mistaken this means I need to use dead battery mode and connect the CC1DB pin to CC1?</p></div>"
